= Haldeman's departure

Former SCPS leader Joshua Haldeman has left the province 2 years after his defeat in the 1948 Saskatchewan General Election, where the SCPS failed to elect a single MLA despite polling 8% of the vote. He and his family are headed to South Africa where he will continue his work as a chiropractor. 

- @wish_haldeman_well: Let's write a pleasant letter wishing him and his descendants well. Civility is, after all, quite important. 
- @haldeman_leaves: Very good! Saskatchewan is better off without him

